<div class="phead"><div class="w"><ol class="crumbs"><li><a href="{{ PathBase }}/">Halvorsen 2027</a></li><li>Volunteer shifts</li></ol><p class="kick">Volunteers</p><h1>Shift board</h1><p class="lede">Canvass and phone-bank shifts, with turf packets and fill counts. For signed-in volunteers and staff only.</p></div></div><section class="sec tight"><div class="w">{% if in_vo %}{% for p in Target.Items %}{%- capture sx_d -%}{{ p.PublishedContent.date }}{%- endcapture -%}{%- assign sx = sx_d | remove: "-" | plus: 0 -%}{% if sx >= todayn %}{%- assign y=p.PublishedContent -%}{%- capture sdn_d -%}{{ y.date }}{%- endcapture -%}{%- assign sdn = sdn_d | remove: "-" | plus: 0 -%}{%- capture _nsl -%}{{ y.slots }}{%- endcapture -%}{%- assign sl = _nsl | plus: 0 -%}{%- capture _nfl -%}{{ y.filled }}{%- endcapture -%}{%- assign fl = _nfl | plus: 0 -%}{%- assign open = sl | minus: fl -%}{%- assign fp = fl | times: 100 | divided_by: sl -%}<a class="shift" href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ p.RoutePath }}"><span class="dblk"><b>{{ sdn_d | date: "%b" }}</b><i>{{ sdn_d | date: "%-d" }}</i><small>{{ sdn_d | date: "%a" }}</small></span><span>{% if sdn == todayn %}<span class="chip today">Today</span> {% endif %}<b>{{ p.PrimaryField }}</b><small>{{ y.time_label }} · {{ y.meet }} · lead {{ y.lead }}</small><small>{{ y.turf }}</small></span><span class="fill"><div class="bar{% if open > 3 %} brick{% endif %}"><i style="width:{{ fp }}%"></i></div><small>{% if open > 0 %}{{ open }} of {{ sl }} spots open{% else %}Full{% endif %}</small></span></a>{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% else %}<div class="lockp"><p class="kick" style="color:var(--brick)">🔒 Volunteers</p><h2>Sign in to see the shift board.</h2><p class="muted">This page is checked on the server: signed out, its contents are never sent to the browser. In the story, the field organizer opens a volunteer account after your first shift, and the campaign manager opens staff accounts.</p><p class="cta"><a class="btn" href="{{ PathBase }}/account/login?returnUrl=/shifts">Sign in</a><a class="btn line" href="{{ PathBase }}/help">How to help</a></p></div>{% endif %}</div></section>
